@startuml
[*] --> ReceiveRequest : [user sends video suggestion request]

state "Receive Request" as ReceiveRequest
ReceiveRequest : entry / receive video suggestion request from user
ReceiveRequest : do / identify user who made the request
ReceiveRequest : exit / identified user

ReceiveRequest --> IdentifyUser : user is identified
state "Identify User" as IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser : entry / identify user based on profile or preferences
IdentifyUser : do / gather user's information
IdentifyUser : exit / user identified

IdentifyUser --> GatherVideos : videos are gathered
state "Gather Videos" as GatherVideos
GatherVideos : entry / gather different types of videos simultaneously
GatherVideos : do / gather trending videos from user’s area
GatherVideos : do / gather videos with similar tags
GatherVideos : do / gather videos from similar genres
GatherVideos : do / gather promoted videos
GatherVideos : exit / gathered videos

GatherVideos --> AddDetails : add additional details to suggested videos
state "Add Details" as AddDetails
AddDetails : entry / add thumbnails and view counts to suggested videos
AddDetails : do / add more information to the suggested videos
AddDetails : exit / added details

AddDetails --> SendVideos : send suggested videos to user
state "Send Videos" as SendVideos
SendVideos : entry / send suggested videos to user
SendVideos : do / deliver the suggested videos to the user
SendVideos : exit / sent videos

ReceiveRequest --> LJ : [valid]
state LJ <<choice>>
LJ --> ReceiveRequest : [invalid]
IdentifyUser --> LJ : [valid]
LJ --> GatherVideos : [videos_gathered]

GatherVideos --> AddDetails : add additional details to suggested videos
AddDetails --> SendVideos : send suggested videos to user

SendVideos --> [*] : completion_event

@enduml
